      "text": "\n\n## Trip highlights\n\nIn the Galápagos, the route takes you across Santa Cruz Island and into the highlands, home to giant tortoises. You'll see lava tunnels, take a speedboat to Isabela Island, visit the Charles Darwin Research Station and walk through a cactus forest to Tortuga Bay beach. Along the way, you may see sea lions, iguanas, flamingos, blue-footed boobies, reef sharks and other wildlife of the archipelago.\n",
      "provenance": {
